### TLS (locally generated dev CA/certs/keys - never commit) ###
# Both cases listed explicitly: the directories on disk are "TLS", and these patterns only
# match them by luck of core.ignorecase=true on Windows. On a case-sensitive checkout (Linux
# CI, WSL) the lowercase forms alone would NOT match and the private keys would be committed.
Config/tls/
Config/*/tls/
Config/TLS/
Config/*/TLS/

### Archives of Config/ - these bundle the TLS private keys and so bypass the rules above ###
*.7z
*.zip
*.rar

### Game client assets - ~7.9GB, far past what GitHub should hold; keep them out of history ###
Data/

### Runtime logs written next to each server ###
Logs/
**/Logs/

### Diagnostic probe state - a runtime cursor, not configuration (see AnsVerifyProbe) ###
Config/AuthServer/AnsVerifyProbe.state

### IntelliJ build artifacts (jars are built from source; no need to version them) ###
out/
